{
  "about": [
    "Unified events conformance (#464): one list both the real runtimes and the SDK testing tools are checked against. Format: docs/design-events-protocol-2026-10-18.en.md §13; the cases of §13.3 come first, then the ones added to cover every rule.",
    "Real runtimes: crates/rutis-loader/tests/events_conformance.rs (rows of one rutis host, its runtimes, and a second node). Testing tools, the cases without `tool: false`: node/rutis/test/events-conformance.test.mjs, python/rutis/tests/test_events_conformance.py, go/rutis/rutistest/events_conformance_test.go. The file is checked for shape by crates/rutis-bridge/tests/events_expected.rs.",
    "Languages (`only` / `except`): rust (the host's Rust plugin), node (a Cordis plugin in the Node runtime), node-leaf (a leaf plugin in the Node runtime), bun, python, go. Fixtures: node/rutis-runtime/test/fixtures/conformance-events{,-e,-f}/ (Cordis) and conformance-events-leaf{,-e,-f}.mjs, bun/rutis-bun/test/fixtures/conformance-events{,-e,-f}.ts, python/rutis/tests/fixtures/conformance_events{,_e,_f}.py, go/rutis/internal/fixtures/plugins/conformance (served by go/rutis/internal/fixtures/runtime; one plugin provides every emitter undeclared, its sync method on the wire `dispatchSync`), and the Rust plugin of crates/rutis-loader/tests/events_conformance.",
    "Scopes: each scope path is one instance of its group, created once; t2's group is `team`, not `tenant`, so that rows placed in t1 are not copied into t2 (a loader instance copies its group's rows). The rule compares ids, so the group names do not matter to it.",
    "Additions to the format of §13.2: a listener's `fails` ({name, message}: its row's apply throws that error, after registering nothing); `typed: \"unit\"` (a Rust unit struct event); `observesDispatch` (a Cordis listener row that also logs `<label>:dispatch:<mode>` from its internal/dispatch for each dispatch of the case's name); the filter `{\"throws\": {name, message}}` (the predicate throws); the step `{\"update\": label}` (the row's config changes, so it registers again); and `expect` on a `load` step. Rust events cross by serde without a declaration, so there is no NoWire case.",
    "The rows: plugin `conformance-events`, one row per participant, keyed by its label; its config is the participant as resolved by the runner (name, kind and log filled in). It injects `events-log`, a host service: add(entry) sync; filter(description) sync (logs `filter:<row>` and keeps the description for `filterSees`); wait(entry) async (resolves once entry is logged, for `cancel`). Emitter rows (labelled e or f) load the plugin `conformance-events-e` or `conformance-events-f` (Python `conformance_events_e` / `_f`): the same plugin, declaring only its own `emitter-<label>` (a declared service is exported whether the row provides it or not), with dispatch(spec) async and dispatch_sync(spec) sync (for bail and waterfall-sync). `conformance-events` itself declares nothing."
  ],
  "plugin": "conformance-events",
  "languages": ["rust", "node", "node-leaf", "bun", "python", "go"],
  "scopes": {"t1": "tenant", "t1/s1": "session", "t2": "team"},
  "locations": ["X", "Y", "host", "node"],
  "cases": [
    { "case": "emit/reaches-all", "rule": "5.4 emit", "name": "t/emit", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"after": 100, "then": {"returns": "A"}}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "host", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": "C"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "emit", "args": [1]}, "expect": {"returns": null, "logUnordered": ["a", "b", "c"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "emit/order-per-listener", "rule": "5.5", "name": "t/order", "vary": ["c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "c", "at": "Y", "log": "arg", "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "emit", "args": [1]}},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "emit", "args": [2]}},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "emit", "args": [3]}, "expect": {"log": ["c:1", "c:2", "c:3"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "emit/order-across-fast-path", "rule": "5.2, 5.5", "name": "t/switch", "tool": false,
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "log": "arg", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "log": false, "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "emit", "args": [1]}, "expect": {"viaHost": true}},
        {"unload": "b"},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "emit", "args": [2]}, "expect": {"log": ["a:1", "a:2"], "viaHost": false}}
      ] },

    { "case": "emit/error-isolated", "rule": "5.6", "name": "t/emit-error", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"throws": {"name": "Boom", "message": "a failed"}}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "emit", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": null, "logUnordered": ["a", "b"], "reported": [{"label": "a", "name": "Boom"}]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "parallel/all-ok", "rule": "5.4 parallel", "name": "t/par", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": "A"}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "host", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "node", "does": {"returns": "C"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": null, "logUnordered": ["a", "b", "c"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "parallel/errors-in-registration-order", "rule": "5.4 parallel", "name": "t/par-errors", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"after": 300, "then": {"throws": {"name": "AErr", "message": "a"}}}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "X", "does": {"throws": {"name": "BErr", "message": "b"}}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "host", "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "expect": {"throws": {"name": "AggregateError", "errors": [{"name": "AErr"}, {"name": "BErr"}]}, "logUnordered": ["a", "b", "c"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "parallel/one-error-is-aggregated", "rule": "5.4 parallel", "name": "t/par-one", "vary": ["a", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"throws": {"name": "AErr", "message": "a"}}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "expect": {"throws": {"name": "AggregateError", "errors": [{"name": "AErr"}]}}}
      ] },

    { "case": "serial/first-result", "rule": "1 no result, 5.4 serial", "name": "t/serial", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "d", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": false}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "host", "does": {"returns": "C"}},
        {"label": "d", "at": "node", "does": {"returns": "D"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": ["x"]}, "expect": {"returns": "C", "log": ["a", "b", "c"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "serial/no-result", "rule": "1 no result", "name": "t/serial-none", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"returnsNothing": true}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": false}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "host", "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": null, "log": ["a", "b", "c"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "serial/zero-is-a-result", "rule": "1 no result", "name": "t/serial-zero", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": 0}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": 1}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": 0, "log": ["a"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "serial/error-stops", "rule": "5.4 serial", "name": "t/serial-error", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"throws": {"name": "AErr", "message": "a"}}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": "B"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": []}, "expect": {"throws": {"name": "AErr", "message": "a"}, "log": ["a"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall/chain", "rule": "5.4 waterfall", "name": "t/wf", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"next": "a"}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"next": "b"}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "host", "does": {"veto": "c"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": "abc", "log": ["a", "b", "c"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall/veto", "rule": "5.4 waterfall", "name": "t/wf-veto", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"next": "a"}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"veto": "v"}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "node", "does": {"veto": "c"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": "av", "log": ["a", "b"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall/terminal", "rule": "5.4 waterfall", "name": "t/wf-terminal", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"next": "a"}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "host", "does": {"next": "b"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": [], "terminal": "t"}, "expect": {"returns": "abt", "log": ["a", "b", "terminal"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall/no-listeners", "rule": "5.4 waterfall", "name": "t/wf-empty", "vary": ["e"],
      "listeners": [],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": [], "terminal": "t"}, "expect": {"returns": "t", "log": ["terminal"]}},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": null, "log": ["terminal"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall/end-without-terminal", "rule": "5.4 waterfall", "name": "t/wf-end", "vary": ["a", "e"], "except": [{"e": ["node", "node-leaf", "bun"], "why": "a JavaScript waterfall always has a terminal (its last argument); the probe passes one returning undefined, which is the same"}],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"next": "a"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": "a", "log": ["a"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall/next-twice", "rule": "5.4 next", "name": "t/wf-twice", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"nextTwice": true}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "X", "does": {"veto": "b"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": []}, "expect": {"throws": {"name": "WaterfallNext"}, "log": ["a", "b"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall/error", "rule": "5.4 waterfall", "name": "t/wf-error", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"next": "a"}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"throws": {"name": "BErr", "message": "b"}}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "waterfall", "args": []}, "expect": {"throws": {"name": "BErr"}, "log": ["a", "b"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "waterfall-sync/chain", "rule": "5.4 waterfall-sync", "name": "t/wfs", "tool": false, "vary": ["a", "b"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"next": "a"}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"next": "b"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "host", "mode": "waterfall-sync", "args": [], "terminal": "t"}, "expect": {"returns": "abt", "log": ["a", "b", "terminal"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "bail/first-result", "rule": "5.4 bail", "name": "t/bail", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "host", "does": {"returns": "B"}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": "C"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "bail", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": "B", "log": ["a", "b"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "bail/async-listener", "rule": "5.4 kinds", "name": "t/bail-async", "vary": ["a", "e"], "except": [{"a": ["go"], "why": "Go listeners are synchronous"}],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "kind": "async", "does": {"returns": "A"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "bail", "args": []}, "expect": {"throws": {"name": "AsyncListener"}, "log": []}}
      ] },

    { "case": "bail/awaitable-from-plain-function", "rule": "5.4 kinds", "name": "t/bail-any", "vary": ["a", "e"], "only": [{"a": ["node", "node-leaf", "bun", "python"], "why": "only JavaScript and Python functions can return an awaitable unannounced"}],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "kind": "any", "does": {"after": 10, "then": {"returns": "A"}}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "bail", "args": []}, "expect": {"throws": {"name": "AsyncListener"}, "log": ["a"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "bail/call-back-into-waiting-emitter", "rule": "5.4 bail, sync-wait", "name": "t/bail-out", "tool": false, "vary": ["p", "q"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "p", "at": "Y", "does": {"emits": {"from": "Y", "row": "p", "mode": "bail", "name": "t/bail-back", "args": []}}},
        {"label": "q", "at": "X", "name": "t/bail-back", "does": {"returns": "Q"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "bail", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": "Q", "log": ["p", "q"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "bail/wait-cycle", "rule": "5.4 bail, SyncWaitCycle", "name": "t/c1", "tool": false, "only": [{"X": ["node"], "Y": ["node"], "why": "a cycle needs two runtimes that do not declare reentrant-sync"}],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "p", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": "P"}},
        {"label": "q", "at": "X", "name": "t/c2", "does": {"returns": "Q"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"concurrent": [{"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "bail", "args": []}}, {"emit": {"from": "Y", "row": "f", "mode": "bail", "name": "t/c2", "args": []}}], "hold": true, "expect": {"settles": true, "throws": {"name": "SyncWaitCycle"}}}
      ] },

    { "case": "scope/up-not-down", "rule": "3", "name": "t/scope", "vary": ["r", "u", "s", "v", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "r", "at": "host", "scope": "root", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "u", "at": "X", "scope": "t1", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "s", "at": "Y", "scope": "t1/s1", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "v", "at": "X", "scope": "t2", "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "scope": "t1/s1", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "expect": {"logUnordered": ["r", "u", "s"]}},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "scope": "t1", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "expect": {"logUnordered": ["r", "u", "s", "r", "u"]}},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "scope": "t2", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "expect": {"logUnordered": ["r", "u", "s", "r", "u", "r", "v"]}},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "scope": "root", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "expect": {"logUnordered": ["r", "u", "s", "r", "u", "r", "v", "r"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "filter/keeps-and-sees", "rule": "6", "name": "t/filter", "vary": ["a", "b", "c", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "host", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "c", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "d", "at": "X", "scope": "t2", "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": [], "filter": {"keep": ["a", "c"]}}, "expect": {"returns": null, "log": ["filter:a", "filter:b", "filter:c", "a", "c"], "filterSees": ["a", "b", "c"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "filter/cordis-this-arg", "rule": "6 Cordis", "name": "t/filter-cordis", "vary": ["a", "b"], "only": [{"e": ["node"], "why": "Context.filter (thisArg) is Cordis's; leaf plugins filter with ctx.filter"}],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "parallel", "args": [], "via": "thisArg", "filter": {"keep": ["b"]}}, "expect": {"logUnordered": ["filter:a", "filter:b", "b"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "filter/global-skips-filter", "rule": "4.2 global, 6", "name": "t/filter-global", "vary": ["g", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "g", "at": "Y", "options": {"global": true}, "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "parallel", "args": [], "filter": {"keep": []}}, "expect": {"log": ["g"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "order/prepend", "rule": "4.3", "name": "t/prepend", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "b", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "options": {"prepend": true}, "does": {"returns": null}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": []}, "expect": {"log": ["a", "b"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "values/every-tag", "rule": "10", "name": "t/values", "vary": ["a", "e"], "except": [{"a": ["go"], "why": "Go receives a set as `any` as a slice (value rules), so its echo is a list"}, {"e": ["go"], "why": "Go receives a set as `any` as a slice (value rules), so the result it returns is a list"}],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"echo": true}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": [[{"$instant": "2026-10-15T03:22:15.123Z"}, {"$datetime": "2026-10-15T14:30:05.25"}, {"$date": "2026-10-15"}, {"$time": "14:30:05.25"}, {"$bytes": "aGVsbG8="}, {"$map": [[1, "a"]]}, {"$set": ["a"]}, {"$bigint": "-123456789012345678901"}, {"$decimal": "1.10"}, {"$uuid": "0f8fad5b-d9cb-469f-a165-70867728950e"}]]}, "expect": {"returns": [{"$instant": "2026-10-15T03:22:15.123Z"}, {"$datetime": "2026-10-15T14:30:05.25"}, {"$date": "2026-10-15"}, {"$time": "14:30:05.25"}, {"$bytes": "aGVsbG8="}, {"$map": [[1, "a"]]}, {"$set": ["a"]}, {"$bigint": "-123456789012345678901"}, {"$decimal": "1.10"}, {"$uuid": "0f8fad5b-d9cb-469f-a165-70867728950e"}]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "values/function-argument", "rule": "10", "name": "t/callback", "vary": ["a", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "Y", "does": {"calls": 0}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": [{"$callback": "upper"}]}, "expect": {"returns": "X"}}
      ] },

    { "case": "unload/waits-and-cancels", "rule": "7.1", "name": "t/unload", "vary": ["b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"waits": true}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "parallel", "args": []}, "background": true},
        {"unload": "b", "when": "b", "expect": {"settles": true, "log": ["b", "b:cancelled"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "unload/not-called-after", "rule": "7.1", "name": "t/unloaded", "vary": ["a", "b", "e"],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": "B"}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"unload": "b"},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": null, "log": ["a"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "registration/loaded-row-hears", "rule": "4.4", "name": "t/late", "tool": false,
      "listeners": [],
      "steps": [
        {"load": {"label": "z", "at": "Y", "does": {"returns": "Z"}}},
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "serial", "args": []}, "expect": {"returns": "Z", "log": ["z"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "cancel/emitter-gives-up", "rule": "5.7", "name": "t/cancel", "tool": false, "vary": ["b", "e"], "except": [{"e": ["node", "node-leaf", "bun"], "why": "JavaScript cannot cancel a dispatch"}, {"b": ["node", "node-leaf", "bun"], "why": "JavaScript listeners have no per-invocation signal"}],
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"waits": true}}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"emit": {"from": "X", "mode": "parallel", "args": [], "cancel": {"when": "b"}}, "expect": {"throws": {}, "log": ["b", "b:cancelled"]}}
      ] },

    { "case": "disconnect/in-flight-fails-once", "rule": "7.2", "name": "t/gone", "tool": false,
      "listeners": [
        {"label": "a", "at": "X", "does": {"returns": null}},
        {"label": "b", "at": "Y", "does": {"waits": true}}
      ],
      "steps": [
